  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have a creature Grappled or Restrained.</p><hr><p>You try to squeeze the life out of a creature you have grabbed. The creature you have grabbed or restrained must make a basic Fortitude save against your class DC or take damage equal to your Menacing Crush damage. On a failure, the creature becomes Stunned 1, and on a critical failure, the creature becomes Stunned 3. A creature that critically succeeds is immune to becoming stunned from Constricting Crush for 1 minute</p>"
